  "title": "Artichoke and Spinach Stuffed Shells",
  "description": "Breath new life into your leftover spinach artichoke dip by combining it with a few filling ingredients and stuffing it all into pasta shells. Full of rich, creamy flavor, these stuffed shells are sure to be a hit!",
  "authors": [
    "John Mitzewich"
  ],
  "date_published": "2012-04-04T17:18:58-04:00",
  "date_modified": "2024-12-06T03:08:08-05:00",
